# Content OS — raw source material that should NOT be committed to a deployed repo.
# Keep the directory structure (.gitkeep) + READMEs, ignore the heavy/sensitive contents.

# Transcripts can contain secrets/PII — never commit raw. Scrub, then force-add if truly needed.
sources/transcripts/*
!sources/transcripts/.gitkeep
!sources/transcripts/README.md

# Screenshots bloat the deploy + may capture tokens/keys. Keep proof assets in R2/Blotato CDN.
sources/screenshots/*
!sources/screenshots/.gitkeep
!sources/screenshots/README.md

# Local scratch
*.tmp
.DS_Store
